    "detailed_description": "<h1>Dive into post-apocalyptic vibes. Wishlist Now</h1><p></p><br><h1>Experience the cyber club vibe. Wishlist Now</h1><p></p><br><h1>Experience survival challenges. Wishlist Now</h1><p></p><br><h1>Dive into a sci-fi universe. Wishlist Now</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><br>Dive into the realm of shadows and secrets with \u201cThe Witch\u2019s Redemption,\u201d where every choice you make weaves the fabric of fate. This ain\u2019t your run-of-the-mill RPG; it\u2019s a gripping tale of redemption, mystery, and witchcraft that\u2019ll have you on the edge of your seat from start to finish.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845430/extras/d64b173d28c7697a6c53839d3797a2ad.poster.avif?t=1754385034\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845430/extras/d64b173d28c7697a6c53839d3797a2ad.webm?t=1754385034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845430/extras/d64b173d28c7697a6c53839d3797a2ad.mp4?t=1754385034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Set in a realm where superstition and darkness reign, you must navigate through a web of secrets and deceit to uncover the truth and save Alice from her sinister fate.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845430/extras/b93624097e89713214e1de747907fc7e.poster.avif?t=1754385034\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845430/extras/b93624097e89713214e1de747907fc7e.webm?t=1754385034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845430/extras/b93624097e89713214e1de747907fc7e.mp4?t=1754385034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Engage in captivating dialogues with the townsfolk, each harboring their own secrets and suspicions. Piece together their stories to unravel the truth behind Alice\u2019s plight and confront the forces that seek to destroy her.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845430/extras/73d8a9ae20b12db395b9a1c0ac419bfb.poster.avif?t=1754385034\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845430/extras/73d8a9ae20b12db395b9a1c0ac419bfb.webm?t=1754385034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845430/extras/73d8a9ae20b12db395b9a1c0ac419bfb.mp4?t=1754385034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>But beware, for danger lurks at every corner. Utilize a dynamic combat system that demands skillful tactics and strategic planning to overcome witches, monsters, and other formidable foes. Dodge attacks, unleash powerful spells, and emerge victorious in thrilling battles that will test your prowess and courage.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845430/extras/80dccabcd90a6fc49e02838f76767157.poster.avif?t=1754385034\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845430/extras/80dccabcd90a6fc49e02838f76767157.webm?t=1754385034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845430/extras/80dccabcd90a6fc49e02838f76767157.mp4?t=1754385034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Venture into crime scenes and embark on intricate investigations, gathering clues and evidence to protect Alice from the relentless tide of superstition and conspiracy. Your choices matter, shaping the outcome of the game and leading to multiple endings that reflect the consequences of your actions.<br><br>Face off against true witches, monstrous beasts, and other dark entities that haunt the land. Only through courage, cunning, and determination can you hope to achieve \u201cThe Witch\u2019s Redemption.\u201d",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br>Dive into the realm of shadows and secrets with \u201cThe Witch\u2019s Redemption,\u201d where every choice you make weaves the fabric of fate. This ain\u2019t your run-of-the-mill RPG; it\u2019s a gripping tale of redemption, mystery, and witchcraft that\u2019ll have you on the edge of your seat from start to finish.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845430/extras/d64b173d28c7697a6c53839d3797a2ad.poster.avif?t=1754385034\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845430/extras/d64b173d28c7697a6c53839d3797a2ad.webm?t=1754385034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845430/extras/d64b173d28c7697a6c53839d3797a2ad.mp4?t=1754385034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Set in a realm where superstition and darkness reign, you must navigate through a web of secrets and deceit to uncover the truth and save Alice from her sinister fate.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845430/extras/b93624097e89713214e1de747907fc7e.poster.avif?t=1754385034\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845430/extras/b93624097e89713214e1de747907fc7e.webm?t=1754385034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845430/extras/b93624097e89713214e1de747907fc7e.mp4?t=1754385034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Engage in captivating dialogues with the townsfolk, each harboring their own secrets and suspicions. Piece together their stories to unravel the truth behind Alice\u2019s plight and confront the forces that seek to destroy her.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845430/extras/73d8a9ae20b12db395b9a1c0ac419bfb.poster.avif?t=1754385034\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845430/extras/73d8a9ae20b12db395b9a1c0ac419bfb.webm?t=1754385034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845430/extras/73d8a9ae20b12db395b9a1c0ac419bfb.mp4?t=1754385034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>But beware, for danger lurks at every corner. Utilize a dynamic combat system that demands skillful tactics and strategic planning to overcome witches, monsters, and other formidable foes. Dodge attacks, unleash powerful spells, and emerge victorious in thrilling battles that will test your prowess and courage.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845430/extras/80dccabcd90a6fc49e02838f76767157.poster.avif?t=1754385034\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845430/extras/80dccabcd90a6fc49e02838f76767157.webm?t=1754385034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845430/extras/80dccabcd90a6fc49e02838f76767157.mp4?t=1754385034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Venture into crime scenes and embark on intricate investigations, gathering clues and evidence to protect Alice from the relentless tide of superstition and conspiracy. Your choices matter, shaping the outcome of the game and leading to multiple endings that reflect the consequences of your actions.<br><br>Face off against true witches, monstrous beasts, and other dark entities that haunt the land. Only through courage, cunning, and determination can you hope to achieve \u201cThe Witch\u2019s Redemption.\u201d",
